{
    "title": "MARVEL Puzzle Quest: Match RPG",
    "description": "MARVEL Puzzle Quest is the premiere Match 3 RPG experience!\r\n\r\nAn epic puzzle battle for the Marvel Universe awaits! Collect and level up your favorite characters to discover incredible strategic puzzle depth like no other Match 3 game has to offer! With over 350 characters, dive into this puzzle RPG with your favorite friends and foes. From Avengers, Mutants, or street-level brawlers, assemble your dream team of Super Heroes. Undergo rigorous training to become a puzzle combat master and solve fun puzzles as you learn to harness their superpowers to bend the gem board to your will. Start your journey to defeat powerful cosmic threats and save the universe!\r\n\r\nPuzzle games and Match 3 meet with RPG gameplay as you level up your team of Super Heroes abilities to unleash powerful moves. Take on Super Villains, deal damage, and influence the puzzle game board in your favor in a hero RPG like no other. Assemble your allies together to form powerful Alliances and take on evil Super Villains in epic Boss Battles. Test your accuracy with Hawkeye or protect your allies with Captain America. The opportunities are endless!\r\n\r\nBattle other players in this epic puzzle game with match three RPG action. Solve matching puzzle games and battle others in seasonal tournaments, climb the leaderboards, and prove your dominance! Choose a Super Hero RPG team or Super Villain squad. Create a tanking support team with Colossus, Captain America, and Kamala Khan, or wreak havoc with Carnage, Kraven, and Venom. The choice is yours in thrilling action RPG games.\r\n\r\nEngage in Match 3 RPG action with challenging puzzles every day for epic rewards. Come back for \u201cDeadpool\u2019s Daily Challenge\u201d with increasingly difficult foes to defeat, or check out special limited-time events. Compete and conquer with your favorite characters from across the Marvel Universe.\r\n\r\nDownload MARVEL Puzzle Quest today!\r\n\r\nMARVEL PUZZLE QUEST RPG FEATURES\r\n\r\nMATCH 3 RPG PUZZLES\r\n- Play matching puzzle games filled with your favorite Marvel characters\r\n- Match 3 or more gems to attack your opponents and fuel your character\u2019s abilities to dominate the gem board in this epic take on puzzle RPG games\r\n- Embark on Raids to defeat the Boss\u2019 minions for a chance to deal damage to the big bad themselves.\r\n- Experience puzzle games in an adventure RPG like no other\r\n\r\nCOLLECT YOUR FAVORITE MARVEL SUPER HEROES & VILLAINS\r\n- Spider-Man, Thor, Doctor Doom, and more! Assemble your squad of Marvel characters\r\n- Solve puzzles, level up, and upgrade their rarity all the way to 5 stars!\r\n- Guardians of the Galaxy or Sinister Six \u2013 the choice is yours\r\n\r\nHEROIC PVP BATTLES\r\n- Prove your puzzle games dominance with characters like Dr. Strange, Deadpool, and Thanos\r\n- Take on friends and other players with your squad of Marvel Super Heroes and Super Villains\r\n- Battle your way up the leaderboard and collect all the Infinity Stones\r\n\r\nNEVER ENDING PUZZLE RPG GAMES\r\n- New characters are added constantly as well as awesome costumes to change up their looks\r\n- Play in Deadpool Daily Challenge for an increasingly challenging puzzle RPG\r\n- Discover limited time events and rewards as you progress in this epic Match 3 RPG adventure\r\n\r\nJoin a community of more than 40 million players and embark on a thrilling journey through over a decade of super hero gameplay and continuous epic puzzle game content. Your next puzzle battle adventure RPG awaits with MARVEL Puzzle Quest.\r\n\r\nEnjoy matching puzzle games today! There\u2019s no time to waste! Download now to start your Marvel Role Playing Adventure!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Like us on Facebook: www.facebook.com/MARVELPuzzleQuest\r\n\u25a0 Follow us on Twitter: www.twitter.com/MARVELPuzzle\r\n\u25a0 Follow us on Instagram: www.instagram.com/MARVELPuzzleQuest\r\n\u25a0 Subscribe on YouTube: www.youtube.com/MARVELPuzzleQuestGame\r\n\r\nCheck back at our socials HQ often for all the latest Super Heroes and news!\r\n\r\nDeveloped by Broken Circle Studios\r\n\u00a9 2024 MARVEL\r\nGAME SOFTWARE \u00a9 2024 505 Go Inc",
    "descriptionHTML": "MARVEL Puzzle Quest is the premiere Match 3 RPG experience!<br><br>An epic puzzle battle for the Marvel Universe awaits! Collect and level up your favorite characters to discover incredible strategic puzzle depth like no other Match 3 game has to offer! With over 350 characters, dive into this puzzle RPG with your favorite friends and foes. From Avengers, Mutants, or street-level brawlers, assemble your dream team of Super Heroes. Undergo rigorous training to become a puzzle combat master and solve fun puzzles as you learn to harness their superpowers to bend the gem board to your will. Start your journey to defeat powerful cosmic threats and save the universe!<br><br>Puzzle games and Match 3 meet with RPG gameplay as you level up your team of Super Heroes abilities to unleash powerful moves. Take on Super Villains, deal damage, and influence the puzzle game board in your favor in a hero RPG like no other. Assemble your allies together to form powerful Alliances and take on evil Super Villains in epic Boss Battles. Test your accuracy with Hawkeye or protect your allies with Captain America. The opportunities are endless!<br><br>Battle other players in this epic puzzle game with match three RPG action. Solve matching puzzle games and battle others in seasonal tournaments, climb the leaderboards, and prove your dominance! Choose a Super Hero RPG team or Super Villain squad. Create a tanking support team with Colossus, Captain America, and Kamala Khan, or wreak havoc with Carnage, Kraven, and Venom. The choice is yours in thrilling action RPG games.<br><br>Engage in Match 3 RPG action with challenging puzzles every day for epic rewards. Come back for \u201cDeadpool\u2019s Daily Challenge\u201d with increasingly difficult foes to defeat, or check out special limited-time events. Compete and conquer with your favorite characters from across the Marvel Universe.<br><br>Download MARVEL Puzzle Quest today!<br><br>MARVEL PUZZLE QUEST RPG FEATURES<br><br>MATCH 3 RPG PUZZLES<br>- Play matching puzzle games filled with your favorite Marvel characters<br>- Match 3 or more gems to attack your opponents and fuel your character\u2019s abilities to dominate the gem board in this epic take on puzzle RPG games<br>- Embark on Raids to defeat the Boss\u2019 minions for a chance to deal damage to the big bad themselves.<br>- Experience puzzle games in an adventure RPG like no other<br><br>COLLECT YOUR FAVORITE MARVEL SUPER HEROES &amp; VILLAINS<br>- Spider-Man, Thor, Doctor Doom, and more! Assemble your squad of Marvel characters<br>- Solve puzzles, level up, and upgrade their rarity all the way to 5 stars!<br>- Guardians of the Galaxy or Sinister Six \u2013 the choice is yours<br><br>HEROIC PVP BATTLES<br>- Prove your puzzle games dominance with characters like Dr. Strange, Deadpool, and Thanos<br>- Take on friends and other players with your squad of Marvel Super Heroes and Super Villains<br>- Battle your way up the leaderboard and collect all the Infinity Stones<br><br>NEVER ENDING PUZZLE RPG GAMES<br>- New characters are added constantly as well as awesome costumes to change up their looks<br>- Play in Deadpool Daily Challenge for an increasingly challenging puzzle RPG<br>- Discover limited time events and rewards as you progress in this epic Match 3 RPG adventure<br><br>Join a community of more than 40 million players and embark on a thrilling journey through over a decade of super hero gameplay and continuous epic puzzle game content. Your next puzzle battle adventure RPG awaits with MARVEL Puzzle Quest.<br><br>Enjoy matching puzzle games today! There\u2019s no time to waste! Download now to start your Marvel Role Playing Adventure!<br><br>\u25a0 Like us on Facebook: www.facebook.com/MARVELPuzzleQuest<br>\u25a0 Follow us on Twitter: www.twitter.com/MARVELPuzzle<br>\u25a0 Follow us on Instagram: www.instagram.com/MARVELPuzzleQuest<br>\u25a0 Subscribe on YouTube: www.youtube.com/MARVELPuzzleQuestGame<br><br>Check back at our socials HQ often for all the latest Super Heroes and news!<br><br>Developed by Broken Circle Studios<br>\u00a9 2024 MARVEL<br>GAME SOFTWARE \u00a9 2024 505 Go Inc",
